{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/jsw9l56tj4m1mjgq3g85ih4qjq66re9.mp3","text":"博士请放心，无论发生了什么，我都会保护你的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d7/4fyu65xnbn7uzu1nhcqs5uedk0zwfnb.mp3","text":"不少黎博利人都有着卓越的视力，有些传说里，甚至有人能从倾盆大雨中辨别出雨滴的样子。听起来很厉害吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0e/1vkntirdnjrdntfsaghxnz6hsc7ph0e.mp3","text":"我在日常生活中表现得过于严肃了？抱歉，这可能是出于拉特兰守卫的一种职业习惯，我以后会多注意一点的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/45/lh6nv251nypn76uastgj7ofds9v9sxr.mp3","text":"对于大多数拉特兰人来说，过于厚重的铠甲并没有什么作用。当然了，在拉特兰举行比较盛大的仪式时，我们也会换上礼服的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/m66warjk4tjhevd01sqk055poffih0t.mp3","text":"感谢你对我的信任，我一定不会辜负你的厚爱。","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_005.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:1/17/0sfoaocxgos62ijtjkmj8gxtm8insud.mp3","text":"嗯......我已经向人事部递交了申请书。我想要成为博士你的贴身卫士。应该说，这也是种职业习惯吧......？","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/cxvxxigk7s2c50jjguvtf33md9wieli.mp3","text":"我从小成长在拉特兰，并没有什么机会接触其他的文明......罗德岛让我看到了许多我没法想象的生活，说不定，也不赖......","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/45/7wc4hea4g884n0qlxrspog4hiskxmq0.mp3","text":"我不后悔了。嗯，是的，虽然当时她们强行把我从拉特兰拽了出来......但确实，这是一场有趣的冒险，我很喜欢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/guflxdi73bu1jbchc1hc8y0wgvrfp8u.mp3","text":"放心，博士，保护你是我的责任。","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9a/fa9dnwt16930ppgmffa5qd0xd1p4us6.mp3","text":"翎羽，原属拉特兰戍卫队，愿意成为你的戟、你的羽翼，为了你的生命而战。","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/69/5z4hdfy5wxfct86v2s5yglofgfdxxsz.mp3","text":"唔，依靠战术也能补足实力上的差距，是吗。","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fc/lov3l4kiiyq6dlnfvwyfq5d9vtjiuq8.mp3","text":"谢谢你，博士。作为卫士，你的嘉奖就是我最好的勋章。","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_013.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:4/40/fspj4nilg68lcfk1ymb3udqtzbwbw28.mp3","text":"做好准备。","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/g4h7ulda0t1i5abafrgcg9jsq3wfxna.mp3","text":"既然由我带领大家，那么，保证各位的安全就是我的义务。","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/bxkli8ppf0g21yawadmaol5txk5ayix.mp3","text":"保护好我方干员！","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/6q07868uey2q1rv9mihsznirxvgb2kq.mp3","text":"请大家提高警惕！","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/npbzpiblt611vbrxp7ei42qsr6muu4q.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/nnoxsv8yhiz0w3jocya2xyjyvpag90f.mp3","text":"知道了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/ag3oesdg9j9jcdsbs6l08fb9u0tzttq.mp3","text":"守住这里。","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/80/6ebo6cwpbicz0crk5ax0hb8ular09xz.mp3","text":"我明白。","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:2/27/p27ttr11z042ujnlyizkvgoibh295zp.mp3","text":"你的速度，快得过我吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/64/lijjzskto1dusrbdv8o4g5rt1f25da5.mp3","text":"你的动作逃不过我的眼睛！","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/16/rast8b81ryjl0vd3l6gyycox91u5ieo.mp3","text":"这把武器里，寄托了我的信念！","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/j8n4bn5rgg0wsz81gu4smcp3xctafbn.mp3","text":"我的战斗，凝聚着拉特兰的荣耀！","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/6pkd2aau3o9n5rsuii611lwww5x6m38.mp3","text":"没什么能让我退缩。","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:1/16/16h49jsjm6pbvn1731r3i26lje53xx0.mp3","text":"狂风吹打山岩，自己反而先粉身碎骨。","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/iqly3estcj233x5dlzi23w9x9q5xani.mp3","text":"重整队列！我会小心剩下的敌人！","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/1qqnd7uxdypvyc8xt4wtl31hkny7mng.mp3","text":"还不可以......倒下！","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/n265gm9l9oloumn2smdfi33vblalarr.mp3","text":"要我在这巡逻吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:3/35/655zkut4947b7dphz1ludpk0ccsz61s.mp3","text":"那里有什么吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/48fb4k63ddr0x9o8cpa7dz773zu2qme.mp3","text":"博士......感觉我在擅用职权了呢......","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/qz3bd4nf48zspuefqsa212quzudlabw.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/cl8jpgn7hv9jtqtnuz17qudm46k0757.mp3","text":"嘴角要上扬一点，不能皱眉，放松，放松......好，就这样去和大家打招呼吧——欸，博士，您怎么在这......那个，新年快乐！","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/je3610uuvge9lv06wyegklvin6o5qv4.mp3","text":"你好，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_192_falco/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/68/enrqh1qid979m1h0k7xwi8o165jv1iu.mp3","text":"博士请放心，无论发生了什么，我都会保护你的。","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:9/98/98uq189dooxk45zq3l7jhhe2amy6jrk.mp3","text":"不少黎博利人都有着卓越的视力，有些传说里，甚至有人能从倾盆大雨中辨别出雨滴的样子。听起来很厉害吧？","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/25/q2vi96m2jvj0wtf7ouu8zhlyhc8pm36.mp3","text":"我在日常生活中表现得过于严肃了？抱歉，这可能是出于拉特兰守卫的一种职业习惯，我以后会多注意一点的。","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/72/ges94comjzp6f5dowph0ehzkl7veepk.mp3","text":"对于大多数拉特兰人来说，过于厚重的铠甲并没有什么作用。当然了，在拉特兰举行比较盛大的仪式时，我们也会换上礼服的。","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/lc7l3ng2j7kgxnel8devx8cb50auqpt.mp3","text":"感谢你对我的信任，我一定不会辜负你的厚爱。","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_005.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b5/ma1fri2d9f4v37btj0fscjykwu3jeur.mp3","text":"嗯......我已经向人事部递交了申请书。我想要成为博士你的贴身卫士。应该说，这也是种职业习惯吧......？","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c1/42rnzea3gupq5ktesvlh5kay7010gej.mp3","text":"我从小成长在拉特兰，并没有什么机会接触其他的文明......罗德岛让我看到了许多我没法想象的生活，说不定，也不赖......","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6c/5y4xq6gkk4qrveakf98vmrq8zrfdbvf.mp3","text":"我不后悔了。嗯，是的，虽然当时她们强行把我从拉特兰拽了出来......但确实，这是一场有趣的冒险，我很喜欢。","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4b/gy7i1jjudvqnea4gmidy4t9t79shi1r.mp3","text":"放心，博士，保护你是我的责任。","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:1/12/f5byeckukpzhdga7nnaqt07dj02vo7v.mp3","text":"翎羽，原属拉特兰戍卫队，愿意成为你的戟、你的羽翼，为了你的生命而战。","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/51/kqg3vi2zpzdixqc7l3prj5ohc7fa9uh.mp3","text":"唔，依靠战术也能补足实力上的差距，是吗。","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:2/22/2ji802tp73610ytmuyczte3cgvg8fih.mp3","text":"谢谢你，博士。作为卫士，你的嘉奖就是我最好的勋章。","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_013.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:2/20/k3lzwq9v5za0prgji45iwnvbz8sgqkc.mp3","text":"做好准备。","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4c/j1nl6s2y8rxl518idrkdiyvog5en1es.mp3","text":"既然由我带领大家，那么，保证各位的安全就是我的义务。","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7e/okdtu8pzrbypc9pvjl8e5qarnz8bnhp.mp3","text":"保护好我方干员！","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cd/8eqahw9i4exfza4cyt6lbquf7xjweqh.mp3","text":"请大家提高警惕！","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:4/43/t0w6af9dzghco4ervecdfkagehnyy3t.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0f/kts1j72v192rbp99naf6bq4u9w626s3.mp3","text":"知道了。","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dc/8dsfpaipuhy8x2ee4i7q2naoh213a4z.mp3","text":"守住这里。","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/23/lrfdguw2tpe5hbdftwd5xtesblugwjb.mp3","text":"我明白。","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/p5tgy2yn7b1zmbzy0yk9fmtbq89431g.mp3","text":"你的速度，快得过我吗？","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/78/szzhgxk95j7d4me0ncbohpqcqghn40t.mp3","text":"你的动作逃不过我的眼睛！","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/84/nr51z824vmbfxltdesz1bz0v5tqnq8q.mp3","text":"这把武器里，寄托了我的信念！","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/64/9hh8rmqdkpr9tg2gds6q1d9zr2o4i6d.mp3","text":"我的战斗，凝聚着拉特兰的荣耀！","alt":"voice/char_192_falco/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cb/72ba4z02njurdgmt0z